{"id":"6f3e60136c4c0887","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-shortest-description.md","title":"Canonical Shortest Descriptions","display":"df-shortest-description — Canonical Shortest Descriptions","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-shortest-description","aliases":["43-df-shortest-description"],"display":"df-shortest-description — Canonical Shortest Descriptions","depends_on":["[[43-df-computable]]","[[43-df-kolm]]","[[43-df-prefixkolm]]"],"source_book":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","source_version":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages","source_location":"§6.1 and §6.5, first convergent shortest description","source_printed_pages":"88; 99","source_pdf_pages":"108; 119","verification_status":"formalization-reviewed","source_statement_checked":false,"source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-shortest-description"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-shortest-description</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-shortest-description — Canonical Shortest Descriptions"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a0589ee7a1cc12e8\" href=\"?note=a0589ee7a1cc12e8\" title=\"43-df-kolm\">43-df-kolm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6cd902d852c2c848\" href=\"?note=6cd902d852c2c848\" title=\"43-df-prefixkolm\">43-df-prefixkolm</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book","html":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"source_version","html":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§6.1 and §6.5, first convergent shortest description"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"88; 99"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"108; 119"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"formalization-reviewed"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a0589ee7a1cc12e8\" href=\"?note=a0589ee7a1cc12e8\" title=\"43-df-kolm\">43-df-kolm</a> 定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 时固定的普通机器，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C=C_V\">\\(C=C_V\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"6cd902d852c2c848\" href=\"?note=6cd902d852c2c848\" title=\"43-df-prefixkolm\">43-df-prefixkolm</a> 定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> 时固定的前缀机器，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K=K_U\">\\(K=K_U\\)</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\in\\{V,U\\}\">\\(M\\in\\{V,U\\}\\)</span>，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G_M:\\mathbb N\\to[\\Sigma^*\\times\\Sigma^*]^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(G_M:\\mathbb N\\to[\\Sigma^*\\times\\Sigma^*]^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Computable}(G_M)\">\\(\\mathrm{Computable}(G_M)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall s\\in\\mathbb N\\;G_M(s)\\subseteq G_M(s+1)\">\\(\\forall s\\in\\mathbb N\\;G_M(s)\\subseteq G_M(s+1)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bigcup_{s\\in\\mathbb N}G_M(s)=\\operatorname{graph}M\">\\(\\bigcup_{s\\in\\mathbb N}G_M(s)=\\operatorname{graph}M\\)</span>，并记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G_{M,s}=G_M(s)\">\\(G_{M,s}=G_M(s)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Computable}\">\\(\\mathrm{Computable}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a> 的有限集合编码接口。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_V=C\">\\(L_V=C\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_U=K\">\\(L_U=K\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma,p,q\\in\\Sigma^*\">\\(\\sigma,p,q\\in\\Sigma^*\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;_{\\mathrm{lex}}\">\\(&lt;_{\\mathrm{lex}}\\)</span> 及规范最短描述由下式定义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"p&lt;_{\\mathrm{lex}}q\\leftrightarrow |p|=|q|\\land\\exists i&lt;\\min\\{|p|,|q|\\}\\;\\left(p(i)&lt;q(i)\\land\\forall j&lt;i\\;p(j)=q(j)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[p&lt;_{\\mathrm{lex}}q\\leftrightarrow |p|=|q|\\land\\exists i&lt;\\min\\{|p|,|q|\\}\\;\\left(p(i)&lt;q(i)\\land\\forall j&lt;i\\;p(j)=q(j)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"t_M(\\sigma)\\coloneqq\\min\\{s\\in\\mathbb N:\\exists p\\in\\Sigma^{L_M(\\sigma)}\\;(p,\\sigma)\\in G_{M,s}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[t_M(\\sigma)\\coloneqq\\min\\{s\\in\\mathbb N:\\exists p\\in\\Sigma^{L_M(\\sigma)}\\;(p,\\sigma)\\in G_{M,s}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\sigma_M^*\\coloneqq\\min_{&lt;_{\\mathrm{lex}}}\\{p\\in\\Sigma^{L_M(\\sigma)}:(p,\\sigma)\\in G_{M,t_M(\\sigma)}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\sigma_M^*\\coloneqq\\min_{&lt;_{\\mathrm{lex}}}\\{p\\in\\Sigma^{L_M(\\sigma)}:(p,\\sigma)\\in G_{M,t_M(\\sigma)}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\sigma_C^*\\coloneqq\\sigma_V^*,\\qquad\\sigma^*\\coloneqq\\sigma_U^*.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\sigma_C^*\\coloneqq\\sigma_V^*,\\qquad\\sigma^*\\coloneqq\\sigma_U^*.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>必须先取首次出现最短描述的阶段，再在该阶段取字典序最小值；任取字典序最小的最短描述未必可由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma,K(\\sigma)\">\\(\\sigma,K(\\sigma)\\)</span> 有效恢复。上述定义的两个最小值均存在且唯一。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 2007-07-28 草稿，§6.1 and §6.5, first convergent shortest description；印刷页 88; 99，PDF 页 108; 119。来源定位沿用附件；此次修订核查形式化与内部一致性，未重新核对原书 PDF。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"f357216a7edb035a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-kolm","status":"resolved","id":"a0589ee7a1cc12e8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-kolm]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-prefixkolm","status":"resolved","id":"6cd902d852c2c848","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-prefixkolm]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-kolm","status":"resolved","id":"a0589ee7a1cc12e8","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$V$ 是 [[43-df-kolm]] 定义 $C$ 时固定的普通机器，$C=C_V$；$U$ 是 [[43-df-prefixkolm]] 定义 $K$ 时固定的前缀机器，$K=K_U$。对 $M\\in\\{V,U\\}$，固定 $G_M:\\mathbb N\\to[\\Sigma^*\\times\\Sigma^*]^{<\\omega}$，满足 $\\mathrm{Computable}(G_M)$、$\\forall s\\in\\mathbb N\\;G_M(s)\\subseteq G_M(s+1)$、$\\bigcup_{s\\in\\mathbb N}G_M(s)=\\operatorname{graph}M$，并记 $G_{M,s}=G_M(s)$；$\\mathrm{Computable}$ 采用 [[43-df-computable]] 的有限集合编码接口。$L_V=C$、$L_U=K$；$\\sigma,p,q\\in\\Sigma^*$。$<_{\\mathrm{lex}}$ 及规范最短描述由下式定义。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-prefixkolm","status":"resolved","id":"6cd902d852c2c848","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$V$ 是 [[43-df-kolm]] 定义 $C$ 时固定的普通机器，$C=C_V$；$U$ 是 [[43-df-prefixkolm]] 定义 $K$ 时固定的前缀机器，$K=K_U$。对 $M\\in\\{V,U\\}$，固定 $G_M:\\mathbb N\\to[\\Sigma^*\\times\\Sigma^*]^{<\\omega}$，满足 $\\mathrm{Computable}(G_M)$、$\\forall s\\in\\mathbb N\\;G_M(s)\\subseteq G_M(s+1)$、$\\bigcup_{s\\in\\mathbb N}G_M(s)=\\operatorname{graph}M$，并记 $G_{M,s}=G_M(s)$；$\\mathrm{Computable}$ 采用 [[43-df-computable]] 的有限集合编码接口。$L_V=C$、$L_U=K$；$\\sigma,p,q\\in\\Sigma^*$。$<_{\\mathrm{lex}}$ 及规范最短描述由下式定义。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"f357216a7edb035a","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$V$ 是 [[43-df-kolm]] 定义 $C$ 时固定的普通机器，$C=C_V$；$U$ 是 [[43-df-prefixkolm]] 定义 $K$ 时固定的前缀机器，$K=K_U$。对 $M\\in\\{V,U\\}$，固定 $G_M:\\mathbb N\\to[\\Sigma^*\\times\\Sigma^*]^{<\\omega}$，满足 $\\mathrm{Computable}(G_M)$、$\\forall s\\in\\mathbb N\\;G_M(s)\\subseteq G_M(s+1)$、$\\bigcup_{s\\in\\mathbb N}G_M(s)=\\operatorname{graph}M$，并记 $G_{M,s}=G_M(s)$；$\\mathrm{Computable}$ 采用 [[43-df-computable]] 的有限集合编码接口。$L_V=C$、$L_U=K$；$\\sigma,p,q\\in\\Sigma^*$。$<_{\\mathrm{lex}}$ 及规范最短描述由下式定义。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"C=C_V","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"K","display":false},{"tex":"K=K_U","display":false},{"tex":"M\\in\\{V,U\\}","display":false},{"tex":"G_M:\\mathbb N\\to[\\Sigma^*\\times\\Sigma^*]^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Computable}(G_M)","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall s\\in\\mathbb N\\;G_M(s)\\subseteq G_M(s+1)","display":false},{"tex":"\\bigcup_{s\\in\\mathbb N}G_M(s)=\\operatorname{graph}M","display":false},{"tex":"G_{M,s}=G_M(s)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Computable}","display":false},{"tex":"L_V=C","display":false},{"tex":"L_U=K","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma,p,q\\in\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"<_{\\mathrm{lex}}","display":false},{"tex":"p<_{\\mathrm{lex}}q\\leftrightarrow |p|=|q|\\land\\exists i<\\min\\{|p|,|q|\\}\\;\\left(p(i)<q(i)\\land\\forall j<i\\;p(j)=q(j)\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"t_M(\\sigma)\\coloneqq\\min\\{s\\in\\mathbb N:\\exists p\\in\\Sigma^{L_M(\\sigma)}\\;(p,\\sigma)\\in G_{M,s}\\},","display":true},{"tex":"\\sigma_M^*\\coloneqq\\min_{<_{\\mathrm{lex}}}\\{p\\in\\Sigma^{L_M(\\sigma)}:(p,\\sigma)\\in G_{M,t_M(\\sigma)}\\},","display":true},{"tex":"\\sigma_C^*\\coloneqq\\sigma_V^*,\\qquad\\sigma^*\\coloneqq\\sigma_U^*.","display":true},{"tex":"\\sigma,K(\\sigma)","display":false}],"bytes":2258,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-110","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-shortest-description]] — Canonical Shortest Descriptions"},{"id":"08c88154570b3baf","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\sigma^*,\\sigma_C^*$ 见 [[43-df-shortest-description]]；$C,K$ 及其条件版本按各定义采用固定机器。自然数条件输出按 [[43-df-pair-coding]] 编码。"},{"id":"d8fd59fd127843f3","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定 [[43-df-prefixkolm]] 的 $K$；自然数参数按 [[43-df-pair-coding]] 的 $\\operatorname{bin}$ 编码。 条件复杂度采用 [[43-df-condkolm]] 的 $K(\\cdot\\mid\\cdot)$。 $\\sigma^*,\\tau^*$ 是 [[43-df-shortest-description]] 的规范最短描述。"}],"outgoing":["f357216a7edb035a","a0589ee7a1cc12e8","6cd902d852c2c848"]}